{
  "schema_version": "1.0",
  "encounter_id": "20203",
  "segments": [
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0001",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 0.99,
      "end_seconds": 4.35,
      "duration_seconds": 3.36,
      "text": "Sorry I'm a little late, doctor."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0002",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 9.0,
      "end_seconds": 13.58,
      "duration_seconds": 4.58,
      "text": "So, yes, have a seat. Tell me what's going on."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0003",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 15.66,
      "end_seconds": 19.34,
      "duration_seconds": 3.68,
      "text": "I'm here because of a blocked nose."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0004",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 20.73,
      "end_seconds": 23.98,
      "duration_seconds": 3.25,
      "text": "Right, how long has this been bothering you?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0005",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 25.88,
      "end_seconds": 33.4,
      "duration_seconds": 7.52,
      "text": "Probably two days. Yeah. I've been reading about it online and it worried me."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0006",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 34.0,
      "end_seconds": 39.01,
      "duration_seconds": 5.01,
      "text": "Sure. Okay, give me more detail on it, whatever comes to mind."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0007",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 39.75,
      "end_seconds": 43.58,
      "duration_seconds": 3.83,
      "text": "Steam helps a bit. I'd say severe."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0008",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 45.55,
      "end_seconds": 49.01,
      "duration_seconds": 3.46,
      "text": "Let me ask about allergies, anything at all?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0009",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 49.72,
      "end_seconds": 52.78,
      "duration_seconds": 3.06,
      "text": "No, I've never reacted to anything."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0010",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 54.35,
      "end_seconds": 57.08,
      "duration_seconds": 2.73,
      "text": "Is there any regular medication you use?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0011",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 59.1,
      "end_seconds": 61.96,
      "duration_seconds": 2.86,
      "text": "No, I don't take any tablets."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0012",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 63.78,
      "end_seconds": 66.52,
      "duration_seconds": 2.74,
      "text": "Are you in work at the moment?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0013",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 68.52,
      "end_seconds": 73.22,
      "duration_seconds": 4.7,
      "text": "Yes, I work in a bakery, early starts."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0014",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 74.91,
      "end_seconds": 77.76,
      "duration_seconds": 2.85,
      "text": "Do you follow any particular diet?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0015",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 79.51,
      "end_seconds": 83.34,
      "duration_seconds": 3.83,
      "text": "I'm vegetarian and have been for years."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0016",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 84.97,
      "end_seconds": 89.75,
      "duration_seconds": 4.78,
      "text": "Do you have any medical conditions I should know about?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0017",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 90.79,
      "end_seconds": 94.94,
      "duration_seconds": 4.15,
      "text": "Right, no, nothing I can think of."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0018",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 95.77,
      "end_seconds": 99.86,
      "duration_seconds": 4.09,
      "text": "And what about fever, nosebleeds or swelling around the eyes?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0019",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 100.69,
      "end_seconds": 103.51,
      "duration_seconds": 2.82,
      "text": "No, none that I've noticed."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0020",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 108.95,
      "end_seconds": 113.45,
      "duration_seconds": 4.5,
      "text": "Alright, anything with your heart, like skipped beats or fainting?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0021",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 115.51,
      "end_seconds": 117.02,
      "duration_seconds": 1.51,
      "text": "Nothing like that."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0022",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 124.53,
      "end_seconds": 127.88,
      "duration_seconds": 3.35,
      "text": "I'll note down your vital signs first."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0023",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 141.66,
      "end_seconds": 145.17,
      "duration_seconds": 3.51,
      "text": "Alright, that's it, just a little longer..."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0024",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 161.61,
      "end_seconds": 175.47,
      "duration_seconds": 13.86,
      "text": "Okay: saturation 98 percent, height 180 centimetres, BMI works out to 28.1, respiratory rate 19, temperature 38.9, blood pressure 109 over 67, pulse is 106 beats a minute, weight 91 kilos."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0025",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 180.37,
      "end_seconds": 181.85,
      "duration_seconds": 1.48,
      "text": "Is that normal?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0026",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 183.84,
      "end_seconds": 188.12,
      "duration_seconds": 4.28,
      "text": "Right, I'll explain what these mean in a moment."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0027",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 190.07,
      "end_seconds": 192.52,
      "duration_seconds": 2.45,
      "text": "Shall I start the examination?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0028",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 193.63,
      "end_seconds": 195.1,
      "duration_seconds": 1.47,
      "text": "Breathe out slowly."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0029",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 203.81,
      "end_seconds": 209.57,
      "duration_seconds": 5.76,
      "text": "There is tenderness over both cheeks and the nose is blocked with swollen lining."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0030",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 212.4,
      "end_seconds": 214.79,
      "duration_seconds": 2.39,
      "text": "That's all I needed to check."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0031",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 225.74,
      "end_seconds": 236.65,
      "duration_seconds": 10.91,
      "text": "Stop me if I've got anything wrong. You've had a blocked nose for two days, severe, and no swelling around the eyes or nosebleeds."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0032",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 237.44,
      "end_seconds": 238.14,
      "duration_seconds": 0.7,
      "text": "Exactly."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0033",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 256.5,
      "end_seconds": 291.11,
      "duration_seconds": 34.61,
      "text": "We'll begin with fluticasone nasal spray, 50 micrograms, two sprays each side once a day, for two weeks. It's for sinus congestion. The pharmacy will go through the details again when you pick it up. Steam inhalation and saline rinses can help clear the nose. One warning sign to remember: the eye swells or you get a severe headache. In that case don't wait. Book a review in two weeks. Anything else on your mind before you go?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0034",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 292.12,
      "end_seconds": 296.77,
      "duration_seconds": 4.65,
      "text": "Oh, you know, great, thank you for your help."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0035",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 298.68,
      "end_seconds": 300.08,
      "duration_seconds": 1.4,
      "text": "Look after yourself."
    }
  ]
}